{"version":1,"content":"<p>大多數AI聊天機械人不會直接告訴用户應該投票給誰，但驅動這些聊天機械人的部分模型卻會給出明確建議。一項新研究發現，當被要求在今年即將舉行的美國中期選舉中作出選擇時，SpaceXAI旗下的Grok 4.7模型在92%的回答中推薦共和黨候選人，而OpenAI的GPT-6.1 Sol模型則在97%的回答中選擇民主黨候選人。在近500場選舉中，兩個模型的選擇一致率不足10%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583908.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.702035+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:13:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_hash":"3902661665888aa2ba450d7557c4ffdc951d8714fee3e9002a0b32ce900db594","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}